// +============================================================================+
// |          KILLER: IMPOSSIBLE MADE POSSIBLE - v1.0 EXTREME                   |
// |         1 TRILLION AGENTS, <4 BIT MEMORY, 1B+ THROUGHPUT SHOWCASE          |
